="16.65"></line></svg></button></form><div class="user_panel_widget base_widget" id="user_panel_7514260"><a data-register_action="header" class="panel_button" data-label="log_in" href="/login">Log in</a><a data-register_action="header" class="panel_button register_button" data-label="register" href="/register">Register</a></div></div><div data-target="browse" class="header_dropdown"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default before_start has_banner" id="view_jam_9042633"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4Mzc3MzM5LnBuZw==/original/QpcNSG.png" class="jam_banner full_width"/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_9286056"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/girly-game-jam-4">Girly Game Jam #4</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://erin-djv.itch.io">Erin DJV</a>, <a href="https://makritza.itch.io">Makritza</a> · <a href="https://bsky.app/hashtag/girlygamejam4">#girlygamejam4</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">233</div><div class="stat_label">Joined</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a data-label="tab_view_jam" class="header_tab active" href="/jam/girly-game-jam-4">Overview</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/girly-game-jam-4/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">3</span></div></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget before_start" id="jam_submitter_2457140"><div class="date_data">Submissions open from <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-08-07 17:00:00</span> to <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-08-16 17:00:00</span></div><div class="countdown"><span class="countdown_label">Starts in</span><div class="times"><div data-name="years" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">years</div></div><div data-name="months" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">months</div></div><div data-name="days" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">days</div></div><div data-name="hours" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">hours</div></div><div data-name="minutes" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">minutes</div></div><div data-name="seconds" class="time_block"><div class="block_value"></div><div class="block_label">seconds</div></div></div></div><div class="state_action"><button class="button fat submitter_button join_jam_btn" data-method="post" data-href="/jam/418172/join">Join jam</button></div></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h2>What is Girly Game Jam?</h2>
<p>This jam is all about celebrating games with a <strong>girly vibe, </strong>because girly games are just as <strong>creative, innovative, and fun</strong> as any other genre just with a little more <strong>~girlypop~&nbsp;</strong>aesthetic! Bring your amazing original ideas&nbsp;to the girly games genre <strong>🌸</strong></p>
<p>Think early 2000s girly nostalgia like <em>GirlsGoGames, Cooking Mama, Barbie, Bratz</em>, etc.
</p>
<p>So what are you waiting for? Let&#x27;s go! Everyone is welcome here!</p>
<p>👉<a href="https://discord.gg/BaNKakq9mU" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">Join our community on Discord</a><a href="https://discord.gg/PVAYv39Ang" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener"></a> to find teammates, share your progress, chat with fellow creators, and stay updated on jam announcements!&nbsp;</p>
<p><br></p>
<h2>The Theme</h2>
<p>The theme will be revealed at the start of the jam!</p>
<p><br></p>
<h2>Rules &amp; Guidelines</h2>
<p><strong>✔️</strong> Be kind, supportive, and respectful to everyone.</p>
<p><strong>✔️</strong> Have at least one of the members of the team have discord. We have important announcements on the server and we ping only for important reasons.</p>
<p><strong>✔️</strong> Use any game engine or framework you like!</p>
<p><strong>✔️&nbsp;</strong>Must have at least a Windows OR browser build, and be playable with keyboard and mouse. More options are great!</p>
<p><strong>✔️</strong> Use&nbsp;pre-made assets or generic code.&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>A</strong><strong>lways make sure you have permission (licenses) and&nbsp;credit anything you didn&#x27;t make yourself!</strong></p>
<p>❌ Don&#x27;t submit AI-generated content, human brains only!&nbsp;No copy-pasting&nbsp;AI-generated code. No AI-generated art or music in your game or project page.</p>
<p>❌ Don&#x27;t include NSFW, 18+, or discriminatory content.</p>
<p>❌ Don&#x27;t try to submit right before deadline&nbsp;(avoid last-minute stress by uploading early!)</p>
<p>❌ Don’t use old games you already made. The majority of the game should be created during the jam!</p>
<p><br></p>
<h2>How do I submit my game?</h2>
<p><strong>Game Info:</strong> Include a short description and a how to play guide if needed.&nbsp;
</p>
<p><strong>Credits:</strong> List all assets, music, or art used.&nbsp;
</p>
<p><strong>Submission Format:</strong> Upload a <strong>browser game</strong>&nbsp;(HIGHLY recommended) and/or <strong>one</strong>&nbsp;.<strong>zip/app for each downloadable build</strong>. One file per build is so that players don&#x27;t accidentally forget something!</p>
<p>Games must be hosted on itchio. Do not link to other builds in the description or comments for bug fixes.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Important!</strong> Once the deadline passes, files <strong>cannot</strong> be changed during the voting period!</p>
<p><strong>DO NOT DELETE YOUR GAME.</strong> If you delete your game files during the rating period, you won&#x27;t be let back into the jam even with the originally submitted files.<br></p>
<p>You can change your game&#x27;s page during voting time, including thumbnail, description text, screenshots, and page design.</p>
<p><br></p>
<h2>Rating Criteria</h2>
<p>Games will be judged based on: &nbsp;
</p>
<p>❤️ <strong>Theme:</strong> How well does it fit the theme? Or have a cool interpretation of it?</p>
<p>🧡 <strong>Gameplay:</strong> Are the mechanics smooth and engaging?&nbsp;
</p>
<p>💛 <strong>Fun:</strong> Is the game enjoyable to play?&nbsp;
</p>
<p>💚 <strong>Visuals:</strong> Are the designs eye-catching and fabulous?&nbsp;
</p>
<p>💙 <strong>Audio:</strong> Is the sound design immersive and fitting?&nbsp;
</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>🌸Tip:</strong>&nbsp;Rating other games and commenting on them increases the chances of your game getting noticed and brings your &quot;karma&quot; score up, which is like&nbsp;cool kid&nbsp;points in the itch.io system :)</p>
<p><br></p>
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<p><strong>Do I need to be a girl to participate?</strong>&nbsp;
</p>
<p>Nope! <strong>The Girly Game Jam is open to everyone!</strong> The goal is to create games that embrace girly aesthetics and themes, but anyone is welcome to bring their unique perspective. We encourage diversity and inclusivity!&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Can I use pre-made assets?</strong>&nbsp;
</p>
<p>You can use pre made assets or generic code, but don&#x27;t use it as an excuse to start the jam before the theme reveal! Don&#x27;t forget to make sure&nbsp;you have the proper license and give credit to the original creators.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Why was my game disqualified?</strong>&nbsp;
</p>
<p>If your game violates the rules in any way&nbsp;(e.g., using copyrighted music, suspected AI, or pre-made game), it will be disqualified.&nbsp;
</p>
<p><strong>Can I appeal a disqualification?</strong>&nbsp;
</p>
<p>Yes! we will leave a comment on your game page explaining the reason for disqualification. If you believe it was unfair, you’re welcome to contact us to&nbsp;appeal.
</p>
<p><strong>I want to do something but am not sure if it’s a good idea... what should I do?</strong>
</p>
<p>Contact us! You can make games pretty freely on the subject, even horror games! As long as you provide appropriate trigger/content warnings (e.g., flashing screens or blood).&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>What happens if I still managed to miss the deadline?</strong></p>
<p>If you have a legit reason you missed the deadline, please contact us immediately through Discord, like ASAP. We&nbsp;usually are available a little bit&nbsp;after the submission deadline is over, but there is no guarantee you will get in late (so PLEASE upload your files at least like 30mins before the end).&nbsp;</p>
<p><br></p>
<h2>Legal disclaimers&nbsp;</h2>
<p>Games are owned by those who submitted them. You are free to change or monetize your game after the jam has concluded.</p>
<p>Submitting a game gives us permission to feature it in a video or other promotional content without your express permission</p>
<p><br></p>
<p><strong>Contact Info:</strong>
</p>
<p>@Makritza or @zebrawithwings (Erin)&nbsp;on Discord&nbsp; (used frequently during the jam)&nbsp;
</p>
<p>&nbsp;<a href="mailto:girlygamejam@gmail.com" target="_blank" referrerpolicy="origin" rel="nofollow noopener">girlygamejam@gmail.com</a> (rarely used)</p></div></div><script type="text/template" id="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_tpl"><div id="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_3409209" class="add_game_to_jam_lightbox_widget lightbox_widget base_widget  force_login has_fields lightbox" tabIndex="-1" role="dialog"><button class="close_button"><svg stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden stroke-width="2" fill="none" role="img" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="svgicon icon_cross2" version="1.1"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line></svg></button><h2>Log in to continue</h2><p>This jam is using <a target="_blank" href="http://itch.io">itch.io</a> to host entries. You&#039;ll need to register or log in on
      itch.io in order to <span class="on_submit">submit your game</span><span class="on_join">join this jam</span>.</p><p class="on_submit">After signing in you can create a new game on itch.io then
      return here and click the <em>submit game</em> button again to enter your game.</p><p><a data-register_action="jam_submit" class="button" href="/login?intent=jam_submit&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fgirly-game-jam-4">Log in</a><span class="or_split"> or </span><a data-register_action="jam_submit" class="button" href="/register?intent=jam_submit&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fitch.io%2Fjam%2Fgirly-game-jam-4">Register</a></p></div></script></div></div><script type="text/template" id="loading_lightbox_tpl"><div aria-live="polite" class="lightbox loading_lightbox"><div class="loader_outer"><div class="loader_label">Loading</div><div class="loader_bar"><div class="loader_bar_slider"></div></div></div></div></script><script type="text/javascript">new I.ViewJam('#view_jam_9042633', {"voting_end_date":"2026-08-21 17:00:00","id":418172,"start_date":"2026-08-07 17:00:00","end_date":"2026-08-16 17:00:00"});init_JamLayoutHeader('#jam_layout_header_8343315', {"autocomplete_props":{"i18n":{"search_placeholder":"Search for games, jams, tags or creators","search":"Search"},"ca_source":25,"ca_types":{"game":1,"featured_tag":7,"browse_facet":8,"jam":4,"bundle":6},"autocomplete_url":"\/autocomplete","search_url":"\/search"}});
I.setup_page();</script></body></html>